[E0414] Error: cannot assign to `b` in the value assigned to `b.x`
    ╭─[ err/86_assignment_order/main.wip:27:9 ]
    │
 26 │     b.x = {
    │     ─┬─  
    │      ╰─── the place assigned, found before the value
 27 │         b = own Point(x: 2)  // frees the box `b.x` was found in
    │         ┬  
    │         ╰── assigned here
    │ 
    │ Note: an assignment finds its place before it computes the value, so the value must not change what the place was found in
────╯
[E0414] Error: cannot borrow `b` as `&var` in the value assigned to `b.x`
    ╭─[ err/86_assignment_order/main.wip:30:18 ]
    │
 30 │     b.x = refill(&var b)        // the same, through `&var`
    │     ─┬─          ───┬──  
    │      ╰─────────────────── the place assigned, found before the value
    │                     │    
    │                     ╰──── borrowed here
    │ 
    │ Note: an assignment finds its place before it computes the value, so the value must not change what the place was found in
────╯
